1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,880
(Sheldon:)Be part of that proud tradition.

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:07,880
(Leonard:)I'll go get Penny while that guy
spits on our food.

3
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:12,220
(Raj:)Do you think they gave Wolverine
an adamantium prostate?

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,990
(Howard:)That's a stupid question.

5
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:16,130
(Raj:)We're having
a conversation about

6
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,760
(Raj:)probing the heinies
of superheroes.

7
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,300
(Raj:)There are no stupid questions.

8
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,870
(Man:)Yes?

9
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:31,270
(Leonard:)Oh, um, is
Penny here?

10
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,240
(Man:)You're Leonard, right?

11
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,980
(Leonard:)Yeah.

12
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,380
(Man:)Damn, it's good
to finally meet you, son.

13
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,600
(Leonard:)Okay, I think a bit of
context here might help.

14
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,690
(Penny:)Oh, hey, Leonard.
I see you met my dad.

15
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:45,270
(Leonard:)Oh, good.

16
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:46,460
(Leonard:)Context.

17
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,690
(Penny's Dad:)Come on in, buddy.

18
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:48,690
(Penny's Dad:)Take a load off.

19
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,090
(Penny:)Oh, gee, Dad,
Leonard can't stay.

20
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,560
(Penny:)He just dropped by to say hello.

21
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,590
(Penny:)Thanks for stopping by, sweetie.

22
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,560
(Penny:)I'll see you later.

23
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:57,530
(Penny:)Bye.

24
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:05,120
(Leonard:)That was odd.

25
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:08,780
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

